    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "0DC137C9AC11B066",
      "text": "Yo, Champ.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0DC138C9AC11B219",
      "text": "Gotta thank you again for conquering the\\nBB League.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0DC135C9AC11AD00",
      "text": "All the tension here melted right away once we\\ngot our new Champion![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0DC136C9AC11AEB3",
      "text": "If I had my Drayster druthers, Kieran and I’d be\\nhaving fun battling again...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0DC13BC9AC11B732",
      "text": "I thought we’d have patched things up by now,\\nbut I guess things ain’t that simple.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "AF30C322A3B69568",
      "text": "It’ll work out!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "AF30C622A3B69A81",
      "text": "Just give it time!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0DC13CC9AC11B8E5",
      "text": "You know just what to say, huh? Good quality in\\na reigning Champion![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "0DC139C9AC11B3CC",
      "text": "Guess I ended up kinda using you to try and get\\nwhat I wanted, huh, bud?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "0DC13AC9AC11B57F",
      "text": "Sorry about that. I didn’t mean to. I dropped the\\nslacker life for once, and I just got carried away.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "0DC13FC9AC11BDFE",
      "text": "Anyway, hope you’ll accept my apology.\\nNo attitude, just gratitude.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "B48C79B064C08D59",
      "text": "Yo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "B48C78B064C08BA6",
      "text": "How goes the busy life of the League Club\\npresident? Nose to the grindstone?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "6F8FF36E35FFF045",
      "text": "“President”?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "6F8FF06E35FFEB2C",
      "text": "Wait—me?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "B48C77B064C089F3",
      "text": "Hang on, you didn’t know? Yeah, the BB League\\nChamp doubles as president. So that’s officially\\r\\nyou now. Them’s the breaks![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "6F8FF16E35FFECDF",
      "text": "I didn’t know!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "6F8FEE6E35FFE7C6",
      "text": "No one told me!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "B48C76B064C08840",
      "text": "My bad! Yeah, that’s the deal![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "B48C7DB064C09425",
      "text": "Don’t worry about it, though! We all got your\\nback.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "B48C7CB064C09272",
      "text": "Even when I was on top of the game, I made it a\\npoint to not call myself Champion.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "B48C7BB064C090BF",
      "text": "That way the Elite Four of us could just trade off\\nclub prez duties...and I wouldn’t have to do ’em\\r\\nall myself![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "B48C7AB064C08F0C",
      "text": "Anyway, I’ll take responsibility if anything gets\\nhairy, so don’t worry. Dive in and prez it up, prez![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "E24683B6C79C3788",
      "text": "Yo yo, bud. Got an update regarding the “you\\nbeing League Club president” thing. And I quote:[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E24684B6C79C393B",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]“Foisting all those responsibilities onto\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]—that’s\\r\\njust\\r\\nnot right!”[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E24685B6C79C3AEE",
      "text": "Yeah, Lacey really raked me over the coals for\\nthat—and for my general slack-offery.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E24686B6C79C3CA1",
      "text": "And so...guess we’re now all stuck splitting\\nLeague Club president duties again.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "5A53EBD7A9F6DDC2",
      "text": "Give it your all!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "5A53EAD7A9F6DC0F",
      "text": "Congrats, co-prez!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E24687B6C79C3E54",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]With all due respect, [VAR 0x0100(0000)],\\nthe\\r\\nDrayster’s\\r\\ntrying\\r\\nto\\r\\ngive\\r\\nway\\r\\nless\\r\\nthan\\r\\nthat![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
