      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "8E0EA67E32F9D7F9",
      "text": "That Duraludon I traded you loves being sparkly\\nclean.\\c\\nGive it a good polishing now and then, would ya?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
